WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.240
This is Galactic Outpost Radio, broadcasting from the Hort Cloud Relay Station, call sign

00:14.240 --> 00:23.320
X-Ray Zulu 42, time check, 2735.215 galactic standard.

00:23.320 --> 00:28.160
Subspace conditions today are choppy with a Cochrane rating of 8.7 and rising.

00:28.160 --> 00:34.400
Non-spheric disturbances reported in sectors 7 through 13 of the Corina Sagittarius arm.

00:34.400 --> 00:40.480
