01:41.560 --> 01:47.560
Scientists are calling this the Cosmic Symphony of the Century.

01:47.560 --> 01:52.560
In cryptocurrency news, the value of Borgcoin has stabilized after last week's Quantum

01:52.720 --> 01:55.240
Blockchain fork.

01:55.240 --> 02:02.240
Current exchange rate stands at 1, Borgcoin equals 0.000001 grams of antimatter.

02:04.920 --> 02:10.520
